    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Curly leafed kale is probably the first thing that comes to mind when you think of kale. The bright-green leaves are sometimes curled so tightly it can be hard to chop them. This kind of kale tends to have a bright, peppery flavor that can become quite bitter.</span></p>",
